WEBVTT

1
00:00:19.115 --> 00:00:20.236
<v><b>Pamela:</b></v> Good luck!

2
00:00:20.861 --> 00:00:22.112
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Thanks, Pamela.

3
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:33.510
<v><b>Pamela:</b></v> Are you nervous?

4
00:00:33.793 --> 00:00:37.640
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Well, a little bit.

5
00:00:46.725 --> 00:00:48.165
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Your sister’s OK.

6
00:00:48.613 --> 00:00:51.752
She’s in hospital, but she’s OK.

7
00:00:52.389 --> 00:00:53.616
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> What a relief!

8
00:01:03.055 --> 00:01:05.250
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> How did the interview go?

9
00:01:05.934 --> 00:01:08.223
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> It went very well.

10
00:01:17.450 --> 00:01:19.338
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> I’m sure you’re going to get it!

11
00:01:20.990 --> 00:01:22.760
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> I hope so.

12
00:01:31.822 --> 00:01:33.568
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> When are you going to come back?

13
00:01:34.630 --> 00:01:35.645
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> I don’t know.

14
00:01:37.061 --> 00:01:39.161
In a week or two…

15
00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:41.261
It depends…